Copyright 2026 Hannes Thöne and the Vanillite contributors

This repository contains two parts under different licences:

- vanillite-jvm/ (the native JVM host plugin, the Java bindings of Vanillite's plugin ABI and
  their generator, and scripts/): Apache License 2.0, see vanillite-jvm/LICENSE.
- Everything else, in particular bukkit/ (the implementation of the Bukkit/Paper API on
  Vanillite) and examples/: GNU General Public License version 3, see LICENSE.

The implementation is written from the public API (signatures and documentation) and from
Vanilla's observable behaviour. It contains no code of CraftBukkit, Spigot, Paper or Folia.
Class and member names that plugins refer to are used as names only.

Not part of this repository and never distributed with it: the Paper API jar and its
libraries (downloaded from their Maven repositories when the layer starts for the first time,
checked by SHA-1; see bukkit/resources/libraries.txt) and any Minecraft server jar.

Uses at build or run time: vanillite-abi (Apache-2.0), libloading (ISC), jni-sys (MIT or
Apache-2.0).
